# `constitution regen` fails when two ADR files share an id: the log's
# ids must be unique (spec §4.3 monotonic ids; plan §2.6 treats collisions
# as a hard problem with `renumber` as the escape hatch). The error names
# both files.

! exec constitution regen
stderr 'ADR-0001-second-claimant\.md: field "id": duplicate id "ADR-0001" \(already used by .*ADR-0001-first-claimant\.md\)'
! stdout .
! exists constitution/constitution.md

-- constitution.yml --
schemaVersion: 1
categories:
  - architecture

-- constitution/adr/ADR-0001-first-claimant.md --
---
id: ADR-0001
title: First claimant of the id
category: architecture
date: 2026-07-01
status: accepted
---

